SUMMARY:Author Talk: "The Greatest Adventurer" with Geoffrey Kent and Ben M
 ezrich 
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 15 spots left\nS
 tatus: You are Confirmed\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/even
 ts/210562\n\n6:00PM Reception\, 6:30PM Discussion \nFrom a single Land Ro
 ver in the African bush to the global travel company Abercrombie & Kent\, 
 Geoffrey Kent has built a life around taking the road less traveled. Join 
 The ’Quin for a conversation with the explorer and entrepreneur\, modera
 ted by co-author of The Greatest Adventurer\, Ben Mezrich\, on the advent
 ures\, ambitions\, and personal stakes behind an extraordinary career.\n\n
 Drawing on his memoir\, The Greatest Adventurer: From the Wilds of Africa
  to a Billion-Dollar Travel Empire\, Kent will share stories from a lifeti
 me of exploration—from crossing Africa alone by motorbike at sixteen to 
 navigating the Amazon and pioneering a new era of luxury travel. Guided by
  the philosophy “Shoot with a camera\, not with a gun\,” his work has 
 helped shape the relationship between travel and conservation.\n\nBeyond t
 he expeditions lies an equally compelling story of entrepreneurship and fa
 mily: the risks of building a global business\, the relationships tested a
 long the way\, and the complicated question of what we leave behind. Toget
 her\, Kent and Mezrich will explore the instinct to venture further—and 
 what it takes to know when you have arrived.\n\n*This event is complimenta
 ry and reserved for members only. Complimentary light bites and refreshmen
 ts will be served. Cancellations made within 24 hours of the event\, or fa
 ilure to attend\, will result in a $25 charge.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/210562
CATEGORIES:The Arts
END:VEVENT
